{
  "name": "DocHub demo: refresh checked status",
  "nodes": [
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## Refresh rows marked check\n\nClick **Execute workflow**. Rows whose **status** is `check` or empty are looked up in DocHub. **status** becomes the sign request's current status (`IN_PROGRESS`, `FINALIZED`, `REJECTED`, and so on), and **timestamp** becomes this execution's time.\n\nRows with an empty **sent** cell are skipped. The document id is taken from the **sent** URL. A row DocHub does not return, or a request that fails, is left unchanged so the next click retries it.\n\nOn **Get current status**, choose the same **DocHub API** credential as the other workflows. On both Google Sheets nodes, choose an account that can edit [the spreadsheet](https://docs.google.com/spreadsheets/d/YOUR_SPREADSHEET_ID/edit).",
        "height": 320,
        "width": 640,
        "color": 4
      },
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [-40, -400],
      "id": "e6c3a9d2-8f46-4b3c-9e53-2a7d0c9f3001",
      "name": "How to run this demo"
    },
    {
      "parameters": {},
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.manualTrigger",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [0, 0],
      "id": "e6c3a9d2-8f46-4b3c-9e53-2a7d0c9f3002",
      "name": "When clicking 'Execute workflow'"
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "authentication": "oAuth2",
        "resource": "sheet",
        "operation": "read",
        "documentId": {
          "__rl": true,
          "value": "https://docs.google.com/spreadsheets/d/YOUR_SPREADSHEET_ID/edit",
          "mode": "url"
        },
        "sheetName": {
          "__rl": true,
          "value": "0",
          "mode": "id"
        },
        "options": {}
      },
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.googleSheets",
      "typeVersion": 4.5,
      "position": [280, 0],
      "id": "e6c3a9d2-8f46-4b3c-9e53-2a7d0c9f3003",
      "name": "Read signers"
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "conditions": {
          "options": {
            "caseSensitive": true,
            "leftValue": "",
            "typeValidation": "loose",
            "version": 2
          },
          "conditions": [
            {
              "id": "status-is-check-or-empty",
              "leftValue": "={{ ($json.status ?? '').toString().trim().toLowerCase() }}",
              "rightValue": "^$|^check$",
              "operator": {
                "type": "string",
                "operation": "regex"
              }
            },
            {
              "id": "sent-not-empty",
              "leftValue": "={{ ($json.sent ?? '').toString().trim() }}",
              "rightValue": "",
              "operator": {
                "type": "string",
                "operation": "notEmpty",
                "singleValue": true
              }
            },
            {
              "id": "sent-has-document-id",
              "leftValue": "={{ ($json.sent ?? '').toString().trim() }}",
              "rightValue": "[A-Za-z0-9]{22}",
              "operator": {
                "type": "string",
                "operation": "regex"
              }
            }
          ],
          "combinator": "and"
        },
        "options": {}
      },
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.filter",
      "typeVersion": 2.2,
      "position": [560, 0],
      "id": "e6c3a9d2-8f46-4b3c-9e53-2a7d0c9f3004",
      "name": "Status is check"
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "method": "GET",
        "url": "=https://dochub.com/api/v2/sign-requests?filter%5BdocumentId%5D={{ encodeURIComponent(($json.sent.match(/[A-Za-z0-9]{22}/) || [''])[0]) }}",
        "authentication": "predefinedCredentialType",
        "nodeCredentialType": "docHubApi",
        "sendHeaders": true,
        "headerParameters": {
          "parameters": [
            {
              "name": "Accept",
              "value": "application/json"
            }
          ]
        },
        "options": {}
      },
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.httpRequest",
      "typeVersion": 4.2,
      "position": [840, 0],
      "id": "e6c3a9d2-8f46-4b3c-9e53-2a7d0c9f3005",
      "name": "Get current status",
      "notes": "Uses the DocHub API credential. Lists the sign request for the document id in the sent URL.",
      "notesInFlow": true,
      "onError": "continueRegularOutput"
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "conditions": {
          "options": {
            "caseSensitive": true,
            "leftValue": "",
            "typeValidation": "loose",
            "version": 2
          },
          "conditions": [
            {
              "id": "has-status",
              "leftValue": "={{ $json.data && $json.data[0] && $json.data[0].status }}",
              "rightValue": "",
              "operator": {
                "type": "string",
                "operation": "notEmpty",
                "singleValue": true
              }
            }
          ],
          "combinator": "and"
        },
        "options": {}
      },
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.filter",
      "typeVersion": 2.2,
      "position": [1120, 0],
      "id": "e6c3a9d2-8f46-4b3c-9e53-2a7d0c9f3006",
      "name": "Got current status"
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "authentication": "oAuth2",
        "resource": "sheet",
        "operation": "update",
        "documentId": {
          "__rl": true,
          "value": "https://docs.google.com/spreadsheets/d/YOUR_SPREADSHEET_ID/edit",
          "mode": "url"
        },
        "sheetName": {
          "__rl": true,
          "value": "0",
          "mode": "id"
        },
        "columns": {
          "mappingMode": "defineBelow",
          "value": {
            "row_number": "={{ $('Status is check').item.json.row_number }}",
            "status": "={{ $json.data[0].status }}",
            "timestamp": "={{ $now.toISO() }}"
          },
          "matchingColumns": ["row_number"],
          "schema": [
            {
              "id": "row_number",
              "displayName": "row_number",
              "required": false,
              "defaultMatch": false,
